MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Wes McKinney

Portions of this product were informed by, and adapted from, msgvault's message
preprocessing and index-generation design. Specifically:

  * src/data/body_cleanup.py — the two-threshold strategy for distinguishing
    base64 payloads from URL paths, and the URL tracking-parameter key list,
    are adapted from internal/vector/embed/preprocess.go.

  * src/indexing/policy.py — the idea of versioning the preprocessing and
    chunk-layout policy into a generation fingerprint, so that changing either
    stales the index and forces a rebuild rather than silently mixing layouts,
    is taken from internal/vector/config.go.

These are reimplementations in Python, not verbatim copies, but the underlying
insights are msgvault's and are credited here accordingly.

